BT 0.06 0.16 0.26 rg /F2 11 Tf 48 650.0 Td (1. Standard Form of a Quadratic Equation) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.16 0.23 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 633.5 Td (A quadratic equation in variable x is of the form ax^2 + bx + c = 0, where a, b, c) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.16 0.23 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 618.5 Td (  are real numbers and a != 0.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.16 0.23 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 603.5 Td (Examples: 2x^2 - 5x + 3 = 0 \(a=2, b=-5, c=3\); x^2 - 9 = 0 \(a=1, b=0, c=-9\).) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.16 0.23 rg /F1 6 Tf 48 588.5 Td () Tj ET
