BT 0.12 0.16 0.23 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 560.5 Td (Method A - Factorization: Split the middle term bx into two parts whose sum is b and) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.16 0.23 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 545.5 Td (  product is a*c.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.16 0.23 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 530.5 Td (Worked Example: Solve x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0 -> \(x - 2\)\(x - 3\) = 0 -> x = 2 or x = 3.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.16 0.23 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 515.5 Td (Method B - Quadratic Formula: x = \(-b +/- sqrt\(b^2 - 4ac\)\) / \(2a\).) Tj ET
