BT 0.06 0.16 0.26 rg /F2 11 Tf 48 489.0 Td (3. Nature of Roots via Discriminant \(D = b^2 - 4ac\)) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.16 0.23 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 472.5 Td (If D > 0: Two distinct real roots exist.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.16 0.23 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 457.5 Td (If D = 0: Two equal real roots exist \(each equal to -b / 2a\).) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.16 0.23 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 442.5 Td (If D < 0: No real roots exist.) Tj ET
